<title>USA: AnnTaylor seaches for new president.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor seaches for new president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>AnnTaylor Stores Corp said on Friday that it has engaged the executive search firm of Herbert Mines Associates to search for a new president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In August, the company reported that Sally Frame Kasaks resigned at chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Patrick Spainhour, president and chief operating officer, was then named to succeed Kasaks as head of the women's apparel retail chain.</p>
</text>
